# 13 API 设计

## 宫殿空间

```text
GET    /learning/palace/spaces
POST   /learning/palace/spaces
GET    /learning/palace/spaces/{id}
PATCH  /learning/palace/spaces/{id}
```

## 房间

```text
POST /learning/palace/spaces/{id}/rooms
GET  /learning/palace/rooms/{id}
PATCH /learning/palace/rooms/{id}
```

## 记忆点

```text
POST /learning/palace/rooms/{id}/loci
PATCH /learning/palace/loci/{id}
```

## 知识物件

```text
POST /learning/palace/loci/{id}/objects
PATCH /learning/palace/objects/{id}
POST /learning/palace/objects/{id}/move
```

## 路径游走

```text
POST /learning/palace/routes
GET  /learning/palace/routes/{id}
POST /learning/palace/routes/{id}/walk
POST /learning/palace/walk-events
```

## 算法建议

```text
POST /learning/palace/suggest-room
POST /learning/palace/suggest-locus
POST /learning/palace/suggest-anchor
POST /learning/palace/suggest-route
POST /learning/palace/suggest-rearrange
```


